  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n[ {2(7)/(8) - left{ {3 - ( {1(1)/(4) - (5)/(8)} )} right}} ] + {{P}} times (1)/(8) = 0\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/eafd54de9d9fc295c072d1fa0b8367ee3ed24189b7ad133a51c29266134693c4.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n[ {2(7)/(8) - left{ {3 - ( {1(1)/(4) - (5)/(8)} )} right}} ] + {{P}} times (1)/(8) = 0\n\n⇒[ {2(7)/(8) - left{ {3 - ( {(5)/(4) - (5)/(8)} )} right}} ] + {{P}} times (1)/(8) = 0\n\n⇒[ {2(7)/(8) - left{ {3 - ( { (10 - 5)/(8)} )} right}} ] + {{P}} times (1)/(8) = 0\n\n⇒[ {2(7)/(8) - left{ {3 - { (5)/(8)}} right}} ] + {{P}} times (1)/(8) = 0\n\n⇒[ {2(7)/(8) - left{ { {(24-5)/(8)}} right}} ] + {{P}} times (1)/(8) = 0\n\n⇒[ {(23)/(8) - { {(19)/(8)}}} ] + {{P}} times (1)/(8) = 0\n\n⇒[ {{ {(23-19)/(8)}}} ] + {{P}} times (1)/(8) = 0\n\n⇒ (1)/(2) + {{P}} times (1)/(8) = 0\n\n⇒ (1)/(2) + ( P)/(8) = 0\n\n⇒ (4+P)/(8) = 0\n\n⇒ 4 + P = 0\n\n⇒ P = - 4\n\n**∴ Required answer of P is - 4.**",
